{"id":"a55604257f2b7c34","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-consensuscut.md","title":"Consensus as a Chvátal rounding cut","display":"thm-consensuscut — Consensus as a Chvátal rounding cut","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-consensuscut","aliases":["27-thm-consensuscut"],"display":"thm-consensuscut — Consensus as a Chvátal rounding cut","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.8.1 Theorem 2.13","source_printed_pages":"99,100","source_pdf_pages":"123,124","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-consensuscut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-consensuscut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-consensuscut — Consensus as a Chvátal rounding cut"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.8.1 Theorem 2.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"99,100"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"123,124"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[n]\">\\(k\\in[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_1,A_2,B_1,B_2\\subseteq[n]\\setminus\\{k\\}\">\\(A_1,A_2,B_1,B_2\\subseteq[n]\\setminus\\{k\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1\\cup A_2)\\cap(B_1\\cup B_2)=\\varnothing\">\\((A_1\\cup A_2)\\cap(B_1\\cup B_2)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in[0,1]^n\">\\(x\\in[0,1]^n\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1-x_k)+\\sum_{i\\in A_1}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_1}x_j\\ge1\">\\((1-x_k)+\\sum_{i\\in A_1}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_1}x_j\\ge1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_k+\\sum_{i\\in A_2}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_2}x_j\\ge1\">\\(x_k+\\sum_{i\\in A_2}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_2}x_j\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(S:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S(u)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in A_1\\cup A_2}(1-u_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_1\\cup B_2}u_j\\quad(u\\in[0,1]^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S(u)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in A_1\\cup A_2}(1-u_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_1\\cup B_2}u_j\\quad(u\\in[0,1]^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S(x)\\ge\\tfrac12,\\qquad x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\Rightarrow S(x)\\ge1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S(x)\\ge\\tfrac12,\\qquad x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\Rightarrow S(x)\\ge1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把两条不等式相加使 x_k 与 1−x_k 合成 1；对只出现一次的剩余文字补加它的非负界，再除以 2，得到 S≥1/2。S 的系数和常数均为整数，所以在二值点可向上取整为 S≥1，恰是两个 DNF 项的 consensus 所对应的约束。连续点不能无条件取整，本页明确区分两层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"A_1,A_2,B_1,B_2\\subseteq[n]\\setminus\\{k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(A_1\\cup A_2)\\cap(B_1\\cup B_2)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in[0,1]^n","display":false},{"tex":"(1-x_k)+\\sum_{i\\in A_1}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_1}x_j\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"x_k+\\sum_{i\\in A_2}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_2}x_j\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"S:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"S(u)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in A_1\\cup A_2}(1-u_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_1\\cup B_2}u_j\\quad(u\\in[0,1]^n).","display":true},{"tex":"S(x)\\ge\\tfrac12,\\qquad x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\Rightarrow S(x)\\ge1.","display":true}],"bytes":1704,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-consensuscut|thm-consensuscut — Consensus as a Chvátal rounding cut]]"}],"outgoing":[]}